            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental biologics application provides for revisions to the US Prescribing Information (USPI) to include updated efficacy data and safety data based on the results of Stage 1a and primary Stage 2 analysis of Study BO21004/CLL11, \"An Open-label, Multi-center, Three Arm Randomized, Phase 3 Study to Compare the Efficacy and Safety of RO5072759 + Chlorambucil (GClb), Rituximab + Chlorambucil (RClb) or Chlorambucil (Clb) Alone in Previously Untreated CLL Patients with Comorbidities\".",
              "doc_id": "ce67705a-ec7e-5f86-af41-f6bc11d0076b",
              "line": 7
            }
