        "description": {
          "text": "Updated labeling with GADOLIN (GAO4753) clinical efficacy results fulfilling postmarketing commitment #3048-2, with no new indication added",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental biologics application provides for revisions to section 14 (*Clinical Efficacy*) and section 6 (*Adverse Reactions*) of the US Prescribing Information (USPI) to include results from the clinical trial GAO4753 (GADOLIN), which addressed the postmarketing commitment #3048-2. The application also provides for the inclusion of Embryo-Fetal Toxicity in section 5 (*Warnings and Precautions*) of the USPI.",
